&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:[email removed]&quot;&gt;[email removed]&lt;/a&gt;. These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Account Executive, UK Government who will play a critical role in building and scaling Figma’s presence within Government organisations. This is a specialist position focused on developing a new and strategic segment, requiring a highly experienced seller with deep domain expertise, strong executive relationships, and the ability to operate in an early-stage market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role currently sits within the Enterprise segment and represents a unique opportunity to establish and grow Figma’s Government business from an early foundation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and build Figma’s Government (Public Sector) pipeline and book of business, focused on establishing initial traction and long-term growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute a GTM strategy for Government accounts, identifying priority agencies and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture relationships with senior stakeholders and decision-makers across Government organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply discovery-led, value-based selling to align Figma’s platform with complex public sector needs and procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans, driving multi-threaded engagement across departments and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate long, complex sales cycles, including compliance, procurement, and regulatory considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams to position Figma effectively, drive deal progression and ensure successful adoption and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lay the foundation for a scalable Government business, contributing to future team build-out as the segment grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience selling into Government / Public Sector accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building new business in greenfield or early-stage markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex enterprise sales cycles (6+ months) with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to engage and influence executive-level buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent performance in pipeline generation and net new business development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating public sector procurement frameworks and compliance processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background selling technical or platform-based solutions&lt;/li&gt;
